<view class="qx qx-flow"><view class="qx-flow-content"><view class="qx-notice">未用积分退现金请联系客服审核，由财务线下办理并登记；实际退款成功后才扣回对应积分。奖励与订货积分分别记账。</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="qx-sheet"><view class="qx-section-row"><view class="qx-label">{{item.statusName}}</view><view class="qx-price">{{item.amountText}}</view></view><view class="qx-muted">{{item.number}}</view><view class="qx-about">{{item.reason}}</view><view class="qx-muted">原公司收款 #{{item.receipt_id}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.last_error}}" class="qx-about">{{item.last_error}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.completed_at}}" class="qx-muted">{{item.completed_at}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="qx-empty">暂无积分余额退款记录</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view></view>
